{
  "sn46.51:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 46.51 ",
  "sn46.51:0.2": "6. Sākacchavagga ",
  "sn46.51:0.3": "Āhārasutta ",
  "sn46.51:1.1": "Sāvatthinidānaṁ. ",
  "sn46.51:1.2": "“Pañcannañca, bhikkhave, nīvaraṇānaṁ sattannañca bojjhaṅgānaṁ āhārañca anāhārañca desessāmi; ",
  "sn46.51:1.3": "taṁ suṇātha. ",
  "sn46.51:1.4": "Ko ca, bhikkhave, āhāro anuppannassa vā kāmacchandassa uppādāya, uppannassa vā kāmacchandassa bhiyyobhāvāya vepullāya? ",
  "sn46.51:1.5": "Atthi, bhikkhave, subhanimittaṁ. ",
  "sn46.51:1.6": "Tattha ayonisomanasikārabahulīkāro—",
  "sn46.51:1.7": "ayamāhāro anuppannassa vā kāmacchandassa uppādāya, uppannassa vā kāmacchandassa bhiyyobhāvāya vepullāya. ",
  "sn46.51:2.1": "Ko ca, bhikkhave, āhāro anuppannassa vā byāpādassa uppādāya, uppannassa vā byāpādassa bhiyyobhāvāya vepullāya? ",
  "sn46.51:2.2": "Atthi, bhikkhave, paṭighanimittaṁ. ",
  "sn46.51:2.3": "Tattha ayonisomanasikārabahulīkāro—",
  "sn46.51:2.4": "ayamāhāro anuppannassa vā byāpādassa uppādāya, uppannassa vā byāpādassa bhiyyobhāvāya vepullāya. ",
  "sn46.51:3.1": "Ko ca, bhikkhave, āhāro anuppannassa vā thinamiddhassa uppādāya, uppannassa vā thinamiddhassa bhiyyobhāvāya vepullāya? ",
  "sn46.51:3.2": "Atthi, bhikkhave, arati tandi vijambhitā bhattasammado cetaso ca līnattaṁ. ",
  "sn46.51:3.3": "Tattha ayonisomanasikārabahulīkāro—",
  "sn46.51:3.4": "ayamāhāro anuppannassa vā thinamiddhassa uppādāya, uppannassa 